  "name": "Question 7",
  "problem": "Let $F=GH.$ What is the value of ${f}_{12}$, if\n\n$$\nG=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 3 \\\\ 4 & -2\\end{aligned}],\\,H=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 3 \\\\ 6 & 5\\end{aligned}]?\n$$",
  "worked_solution": "Multiplying the $1$st row in $G$ by the $2$nd column in $H$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{12} & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =2\\cdot 3+3\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =6+15 \\\\  & =21.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
